# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""wowhead 首领攻略（enUS 对照层，_df_wh_guide_gen.py 生成）。

键 = Data_DungeonGuide.lua 里的 zhCN 攻略全文，值 = wowhead 英文原文（回填英文名 + 手工补丁）。
zhTW 由 gen_zhtw_data.py 对 zhCN 自动 opencc，不经本表。
"""

FREE = {
    "13~18 级即可进入，怪物密度低、机制浅，没有控制技能的队伍也能轻松打通。": "Tuned for levels 13-18 with low mob density and simple mechanics — groups without CC can clear it comfortably.",
    "5 个副本任务全部为部落专属，进本前先接齐。": "All 5 dungeon quests are Horde-exclusive — pick them all up before entering.",
    "一场战斗里同时出现两只以上会催眠的德鲁伊基本等于团灭：一次只拉一只，多引到的立刻控制。": "Two or more sleeping druids in one fight is nearly a guaranteed wipe: pull them one at a time and instantly CC any extra pulls.",
    "不少怪群一次有 5~6 只，强烈建议带上控场（变形术、冰冻陷阱等），每次开怪先标记集火目标。": "Many pulls pack 5-6 mobs: bring crowd control (Polymorph, Freezing Trap, etc.) and mark a kill target on every pull.",
    "丹莫罗地下的侏儒故都：5 个 boss 加稀有精英、面积大岔路多，公认最容易迷路的经典副本之一。": "The gnomes' former capital beneath Dun Morogh: 5 bosses plus a rare across a sprawling, maze-like layout — one of Classic's most confusing dungeons to navigate.",
    "事件第一阶段很简单：护送膜拜者走到仪式石旁。护送路上清掉剩余小怪（推进副本时大多已经清了）。膜拜者到达纳拉雷克斯身边开始最终仪式后，会一波波刷小怪冲过来杀他——保持 AOE 输出活着，尽快烧掉小怪。第 2 波之后吞噬者穆坦努斯登场。他非常有挑战性：两个群体控制技能，加上雷霆震裂对周围目标伤害巨大，是近战的噩梦。这场战斗考验队伍配置——要有足够的远程输出，并且主治疗之外至少一个混合职业帮忙分担雷霆震裂的伤害。没有取巧的办法：治疗保持最远距离拉血线，活下来。掉落很好，值得打。": "The first part of the event is simple; escort the Disciple through the Wailing Caverns towards the ritual stone. To escort him, will require you to clear out any remaining adds on the way to the rock, most of which should already be cleared by progressing through the dungeon. Once the Disciple reaches Naralex and begins his final ritual, waves of adds will approach the Disciple to kill him. Burn down the adds while keeping your AOE DPS alive. After the 2nd wave of adds, Mutanus will appear to kill your group and the Disciple. He is very challenging, as he possesses two forms of crowd control that can be used against your group. Additionally, his Thundercrack ability does a massive amount of damage to nearby targets, making this fight a nightmare for your melee DPS. Mutanus is a group composition check - make sure to have a healthy set of ranged DPS and at least one hybrid healing class aside from your main healer to assist with the thunderclap damage. There are no special tricks for this fight - stay at max range while healing up the group and try to stay alive. This fight is worth the trouble, as the loot is quite good.",
    "从东部王国乘船到棘齿城；": "Take the boat to Ratchet;",
    "从十字路口出发向西南走，在繁茂绿洲找到洞穴入口，穿过蛇形洞道即可进入副本。": "From the Crossroads, travel southwest to the Lushwater Oasis and find the cavern entrance; the instance portal lies at the end of the winding cavern.",
    "从灰谷的阿斯特兰纳出发；": "Start from Astranaar in Ashenvale;",
    "从铁炉堡出发，沿丹莫罗大路一路向西走到诺莫瑞根；": "From Ironforge, travel west along the road through Dun Morogh to Gnomeregan;",
    "克雷什是一场直白的坦克加木桩战，只有一个偶尔使目标眩晕的技能。他护甲和基础伤害都很高，如果队伍近战偏多，战斗会拖得比较久，治疗也会稍感烦躁。总体没有难度。": "Kresh is a straightforward tank and spank, featuring only one ability that occasionally dazes its target. Kresh has a large amount of armor and base damage, and if you have a melee-heavy group, this fight can drag on and be a slight nuisance for your healer. Overall, this is not a challenging encounter.",
    "入口在水下，要从海底通道游进去；老塞拉基斯等区域也要潜水，经典服呼吸条时间短得多，别贪深。": "The entrance is underwater — swim in through a submerged tunnel, and sections like Old Serra'kis' lair require diving. Breath meters run out much faster in Classic, so plan ahead.",
    "全本巡逻密集，经常在队伍打完 boss、舔包掷骰吃喝放松警惕时摸过来。没有特别解法：推进时多转视角观察四周，尤其是杀完 boss 之后。": "Patrols are everywhere and often catch groups off guard while they loot, roll and drink after a boss kill. No special trick required — just pan your camera around as you progress, especially after boss kills.",
    "击杀全部 4 位毒牙领主后可开启纳拉雷克斯事件：护送纳拉雷克斯的门徒到祭坛完成仪式；事件中门徒死亡或团灭即失败，需重置副本才能重来。": "After slaying all 4 Lords of the Fang you can start the Naralex event: escort the Disciple of Naralex to the ritual stone. If the Disciple dies or the group wipes, the event fails and can only be retried after a full instance reset.",
    "击杀常青的维尔丹后可解锁他身后的瀑布捷径。": "Killing Verdan the Everliving unlocks the waterfall shortcut behind him.",
    "到十字路口西南方的繁茂绿洲找到洞穴入口，进入副本。": "reach the Lushwater Oasis southwest of the Crossroads and enter the cavern to zone in.",
    "副本 3 个任务全部为部落专属。": "All 3 dungeon quests are Horde-exclusive.",
    "副本 6 个任务全部为联盟专属。": "All 6 dungeon quests are Alliance-exclusive.",
    "副本入口位于奥格瑞玛暗影裂口最深处，一路走到头就能看到副本门，进门即本。": "The entrance is at the far end of the Cleft of Shadow inside Orgrimmar — walk in and zone in; no travel required.",
    "副本入口外就是集合石，进门即本。": "the Meeting Stone is right outside the instance entrance — walk in and zone in.",
    "副本共 12 个任务（7 联盟、2 部落、3 中立）。": "There are 12 quests in total (7 Alliance, 2 Horde, 3 neutral).",
    "副本共 7 个任务（2 个部落专属、5 个中立），进本前先接齐。": "There are 7 quests in total (2 Horde-exclusive, 5 neutral) — pick them all up before entering.",
    "副本共 9 个任务（4 联盟、4 部落、1 中立），进本前接齐。": "There are 9 quests in total (4 Alliance, 4 Horde, 1 neutral) — pick them up before entering.",
    "副本就在奥格瑞玛暗影裂口深处，进门即本；灵魂医者也在门口，团灭后跑尸路程很短。": "The dungeon sits deep in the Cleft of Shadow inside Orgrimmar — the entrance is right there, and the Spirit Healer at the door makes for a short corpse run.",
    "副本就在暴风城法师区东北角，入口外就是集合石，进城即本。": "The dungeon sits in the northeast corner of Stormwind's Mage Quarter with the Meeting Stone right outside — you're in the instance as soon as you're in the city.",
    "副本巡逻队": "Dungeon Patrols",
    "副本有两个入口，均位于车厂区：前门（西侧）通向齿轮大厅，后门（北侧）通向工程实验室。": "the dungeon has two entrances in the Train Depot: the front entrance (west side) leads to the Clockwerk Run, and the backdoor entrance (north side) leads to the Engineering Labs.",
    "副本有两个入口，都在车厂区：前门（西侧）通向齿轮大厅，后门（北侧）通向工程实验室；后门需要车间钥匙或工程学 150 才能开启。": "The dungeon has two entrances in the Train Depot: the front entrance (west side) leads to the Clockwerk Run, the backdoor entrance (north side) leads to the Engineering Labs — the backdoor requires the Workman's Key or engineering skill of at least 150.",
    "加摩拉是简单的坦克加木桩，但有个坑：他护甲极高、受到的伤害大幅降低。他会周期性施放投网，注意分散站位。整场很简单，无需多讲。": "Ghamoo-ra is a simple tank and spank with a catch - the boss has a tremendous amount of armor and takes significantly reduced damage. Every so often, he will cast his primary ability, so make sure to stay spread out. This is a simple encounter with very little explanation required.",
    "北贫瘠之地繁茂绿洲下的蛇窟：7 个 boss、流程非线性岔路多，毒牙德鲁伊的催眠术是全程最大威胁。": "A serpent-filled cavern beneath the Lushwater Oasis in the Northern Barrens: 7 bosses across a confusing non-linear layout, with the Druids of the Fang's sleep spell as the biggest threat throughout.",
    "变异精灵龙护甲低、伤害高，本身没有关键技能。难点在于这是一次拉 4 只全精英的战斗，其中还有两只毒牙德鲁伊——德鲁伊的睡眠多半会读出来。策略：控制住一只德鲁伊，集火烧掉另一只并尽量打断催眠。坦克同时扛着 3 只精英的伤害，队里若有治疗之外的混合职业，让他们穿插补一些辅助治疗。这场战斗考验队伍集火单一目标的能力，配合默契就轻松。": "Deviate Faerie Dragon is a low armor, high damage mob that possesses no significant abilities. The challenge in this encounter comes from the fact that this is a 4-mob pull, all of which are elites. Two Druids of the Fang are also included in this pull, meaning that Druid's Slumber is likely to go off in this fight. Your strategy should be to CC one of the Druids while burning the other one down and interrupting its 'Sleep' whenever possible. Your tank will be taking damage from 3 different elites here, so if you have any hybrid classes in your group aside from the healer, make sure that they weave in some support heals during their rotation. This fight will test your group's ability to focus down a single target, so if you're coordinated and all on the same page, it should be a breeze.",
    "可怕的塔格尔房间里围着几名迪菲亚。开怪前至少控制一只：坦克拉住剩余小怪和塔格尔，站位远离被控小怪。全队先集火秒掉小怪再转火塔格尔。Boss 和第一只小怪死后，记得补掉被控的那只。": "A few Defias surround Targorr the Dread in his room. Make sure to CC at least one Defias before engaging him. Allow your tank to pick up the remaining add and Targorr and station him away from the CC'ed add. All DPS should work to nuke down the add first as before switching to Targorr. Make sure to kill the CC'ed add once the boss and the first add are dead.",
    "吞噬者芬鲁斯是个不难的 Boss，唯一值得注意的技能是一个持续伤害。整体直白的坦克加木桩。": "Fenrus the Devourer is an easy enough boss, with their only notable ability being a DoT. This encounter is a straightforward tank and spank.",
    "和塔格尔以及本副本多数 Boss 一样，卡姆·深怒房间里围着几名迪菲亚。开怪前至少控制一只：坦克拉住剩余小怪和卡姆，站位远离被控小怪。全队先集火秒掉小怪再转火卡姆。Boss 和第一只小怪死后，记得补掉被控的那只。": "Like Targorr and many of the other bosses in this dungeon, Kam Deepfury is surrounded by a few Defias in his room. Make sure to CC at least one Defias before engaging him. Allow your tank to pick up the remaining add and Kam and station him away from the CC'ed add. All DPS should work to nuke down the add first as before switching to Kam. Make sure to kill the CC'ed add once the boss and the first add are dead.",
    "和奥格弗林特一样，祈求者耶戈什身边也有两只小怪：控制住一只，先集火另一只，再转火 Boss。他会施放献祭和虚弱诅咒，对想抢仇恨的坦克和对治疗都是不小的压力，但整体仍是场简单直接的战斗。": "Like Oggleflint, Jergosh the Invoker is flanked by two mobs. One of the mobs should be CC'ed while the other is focused down before transitioning to Jergosh. He casts Immolate and Curse of Weakness which can be a problem for tanks trying to gain threat and intense on healers, but overall this is a simple and straightforward fight.",
    "哀嚎卫兵": "Wailing Guardsman",
    "哀嚎卫兵的 往日的尖啸 会沉默 5 码内所有人 5 秒：施法职业尤其治疗，保持 5 码以上距离。": "Wailing Guardsmen cast Screams of the Past, silencing everyone within 5 yards for 5 seconds: keep casters — especially your healer — at least 5 yards away.",
    "哀嚎的卫兵 是上层区的幽灵怪，其 往日的尖啸 会沉默 5 码内所有人 5 秒。施法职业与其保持 5 码以上距离，治疗尤其要注意站位。": "Wailing Guardsman, a ghostly humanoid on the upper levels, casts Screams of the Past, silencing all players within 5 yards for 5 seconds. Keep spellcasters at least 5 yards away — especially your healer.",
    "哈姆霍克两侧各有一名迪菲亚。开怪前至少控制一只：坦克拉住剩余小怪和哈姆霍克，站位远离被控小怪。全队先集火秒掉小怪再转火他。注意他的闪电链——近战扎堆时很痛，尽量分散站位减伤。": "Two Defias flank Hamhock. Make sure to CC at least one Defias before engaging him. Allow your tank to pick up the remaining add and Hamhock and station him away from the CC'ed add. All DPS should work to nuke down the add first as before switching to Hamhock. Be wary of his Chain Lightning ability, which can be nasty in melee heavy groups. Make sure to spread out as much as possible to reduce its damage.",
    "在暴风城内前往法师区东北角；": "Head to the northeast corner of the Mage Quarter in Stormwind;",
    "在海边潜入水下通道，进入副本。": "dive into the underwater passage at the shore to zone in.",
    "地狱战马和暗影军马伤害极高，而且不管引得多小心，拉一只就会带出全部三只。至少变羊一匹，让猎人或术士的宠物坦克第二匹，主坦克带 DPS 集火第三匹，再逐只轮换。治疗要有心理准备：这一场伤害量非常大。": "The Fel Steed and Shadow Charger deal an incredibly high amount of damage and pulling one of them will pull all three, regardless of how carefully you pull the first mob. Make sure to polymorph at least one of the horses and have a hunter or warlock pet tank the second while your main tank and DPS is focused on the third before cycling to the next mob. Your healer should be aware of the massive amount of damage that will be incoming during this encounter.",
    "地精工匠 与 地精工程师 是全本最凶的小怪，守在地精锻造房、吉尔尼德门前。他们的 召唤遥控傀儡 会召唤出危险的机械傀儡：读条时用晕打断（圣骑士的 制裁之锤 正好用），或控制住多余的地精。如果傀儡已经放出来了，优先杀召唤它的地精——傀儡会随召唤者死亡而消失。": "Goblin Craftsman and Goblin Engineer, found in the Goblin Foundry before Gilnid, are two of the most vicious mobs in the dungeon. Their Summon Remote-Controlled Golem summons a deadly miniature robot: stun them mid-cast (a Paladin's Hammer of Justice works perfectly) or CC the extras. If a golem does get summoned, kill the goblin first — the golem despawns once its summoner dies.",
    "地精工程师与工匠": "Goblin Engineer and Craftsman",
    "地精锻造房的工程师会读 召唤遥控傀儡 召唤危险的机械傀儡：读条时晕掉，或先杀工程师——傀儡会随召唤者一起消失。": "In the Goblin Foundry, engineers cast Summon Remote-Controlled Golem to summon a deadly robot: stun the cast, or kill the engineer first — the golem despawns with its summoner.",
    "基尔尼格和本副本多数 Boss 一样基本是坦克加木桩。他身边有个地精工程师会随战斗一起开怪：务必控制住工程师，因为他可能施放召唤遥控傀儡——召唤出的机械傀儡免疫大部分技能。真被召出来了就集火秒掉工程师，召唤者一死傀儡随之消失。开怪前控制住小怪即可免掉这个麻烦。": "Gilnid like many of the bosses in this dungeon, is mostly a simple tank-and-spank. He is flanked by a Goblin Engineer that will pull once Gilnid has been engaged. Make sure to CC the engineer as he may cast Summon Remote-Controlled Golem, which summons a mechanical robot that is immune to most abilities. If the robot does get summoned, focus the engineer that summoned it as the robot will despawn once its summoner is dead. You can avoid this headache by simply CCing the add before the pull.",
    "多个 boss 身边带 1~2 只小怪：开怪前先控制住一只，全队集火秒掉剩下的怪再转 boss。": "Several bosses come with 1-2 adds: CC one before the pull, nuke the remaining add down, then switch to the boss.",
    "多处大怪群，控场职业很好用；不少怪群里混着法系怪，记得打断或恐惧。": "Several large packs await: crowd control shines here, and many packs contain casters — stun, fear or interrupt them.",
    "大法师阿鲁高是全本最难：虚空箭伤害爆炸、还会随机传送。远程进门就站上平台输出，近战别追，等他传送到自己面前再打。": "Archmage Arugal is by far the hardest boss: massive Void Bolts and random teleports. Have ranged DPS stand on the platform upon entering and burn him from there; melee should wait for the teleport instead of chasing.",
    "大量非精英小怪混精英的组合很多，AOE 与顺劈收益极高；怪物以穴居人、病态侏儒和机械为主。": "Many pulls mix elites with large packs of non-elites: AoE and cleave are extremely valuable. Expect Troggs, Diseased Gnomes and Mechs.",
    "奥格弗林特的房间里有两只穴居人护卫。开怪前至少控制住一只；让坦克拉住剩下的那只，并把奥格弗林特背对人群（他有顺劈斩）。所有输出先集火秒掉被拉住的小怪，再转火奥格弗林特。Boss 和第一只小怪都死后，记得补掉被控制的那只。": "Oggleflint is flanked by 2 troggs in his room. Make sure to CC at least one trogg before engaging him. Allow your tank to pick up the remaining add and face Oggleflint away from the group (cleave). All dps should work to nuke down the add first as before switching to Oggleflint. Make sure to kill the CC'ed add once the boss and the first add are dead.",
    "奥格瑞玛地下的熔岩洞窟：4 个 boss、流程线性、机制简单，公认游戏里最容易的入门副本。": "A lava cave beneath Orgrimmar: 4 bosses on a short linear route with trivial mechanics, widely considered the easiest dungeon in the game.",
    "安娜科德拉多半是你在哀嚎洞穴遇到的第一个毒牙德鲁伊 Boss。和所有德鲁伊一样她有四个技能，其中闪电箭和催眠术与其他同伴共享。最危险的是催眠术：会点名队伍里任何人，包括坦克或治疗，务必第一时间打断。如果战斗中又引到一只毒牙德鲁伊，立刻控制住——一个催眠术尚可应付，两个以上基本团灭。打断到位、引怪小心，这场战斗并不难。": "Lady Anacondra is likely to be the first of the Druid bosses you will encounter in the Wailing Caverns. Like all of the druids, she has four abilities, 2 of which are shared by her contemporaries (Lightning Bolt and Sleep). Her most threatening ability is 'Sleep,' which can be applied to anyone in your party, including the Tank or Healer. To deal with this ability, make sure to interrupt it immediately. If you happen to pull another Druid of the Fang during the encounter, make sure to CC it right away as one 'Sleep' can be dealt with, but 2 or more will result in a wipe. If your interrupts are on point and you've pulled carefully, this fight should be easy.",
    "尖牙德鲁伊 是本副本唯一需要特别注意的小怪：法术伤害高，催眠 德鲁伊的睡眠 能沉睡任意目标最长 15 秒，点到治疗会直接瘫痪治疗。一次只打一只，附近的先控制住；读到催眠立刻打断。战斗拖久后他们会施放 使自己沉默，之后就再也放不出催眠了。": "Druid of the Fang is the only trash mob that demands real attention: a hard-hitting caster whose Sleep Druid's Slumber can incapacitate any target for up to 15 seconds, effectively neutralizing your healer if it lands. Fight them one at a time and CC any extras; interrupt Sleep on sight. After a while they cast on themselves, silencing them and removing the sleep threat for good.",
    "屠夫拉佐克劳是简单的坦克加木桩。开怪前清掉房间和周边巡逻即可，技能无足轻重，无需赘述。": "Razorclaw the Butcher is a simple tank and spank. Make sure to clear the room before you pull him, as well as the surrounding patrols. His Abilities are negligible, and no further explanation is required.",
    "巴基尔·斯瑞德理论上只是坦克加木桩，但等级高、又有烟雾弹，对某些队伍并不轻松。保持坦克满血，别让他在烟雾弹眩晕期间倒下。他单目标伤害很高，队里有混合输出就让他们帮治疗补位，随时刷坦克。": "Bazil Thredd is a simple tank and spank in theory, but his high level and Smoke Bomb make him difficult for some groups. Make sure to keep the tank topped off, so he/she does not die during a smoke bomb stun. Bazil deals a high amount of single target damage, so if you have any hybrid DPS in your group, make sure to have them support the healer and spot-heal the tank when needed.",
    "巴扎兰同样带两只小怪，但右侧那只（他自己的左手边）可以不引到 Boss 单独拉开，能大幅降低战斗难度。另一只控制住，全队集火 Boss —— 他单目标伤害很高，要尽快击杀。其余就是普通的坦克拉住打木桩。": "Bazzalan also has 2 adds, but the mob on the right (his left) can be pulled without engaging the boss, greatly reducing the difficulty of the fight. The other mob should be CC'ed while the group focuses on the boss as he deals significant single-target damage and should be killed ASAP. Other than that, another tank-and-spank.",
    "布鲁高·铁拳打法简单直接，掉落却是全副本最好的。但他是稀有刷新，一趟里多半碰不到。开怪前清掉他周围的小怪。他就是坦克加木桩的教科书。": "Bruegal Ironknuckle is simple, straightforward, and drops the best loot the dungeon has to offer. However, because he is a rare spawn, you are unlikely to find him during your run. Make sure to clear the adds around him before engaging. He is the literal definition of a tank and spank.",
    "席瓦莱恩男爵的难点在于等级高（24 级）加上核心技能暗影迷雾——降低目标 75% 治疗效果，相当于强化版致死打击。混合职业必须帮治疗一起刷坦克，否则坦克很快倒下。其余照旧打木桩。": "What makes Baron Silverlaine challenging is his higher level (24) and his primary ability, Veil of Shadow. This ability reduces healing effects on a target by 75%, effectively serving as a beefed up mortal strike. Make sure your hybrid classes are assisting the healer here with tank healing as the tank will go down quickly otherwise. Aside from that, the fight is a tank and spank.",
    "建议脱光装备做好跑尸准备，一路跑尸进到暗影裂口深处，进入副本。": "strip off your armor and corpse-run your way to the Cleft of Shadow until you can safely zone into the instance.",
    "开怪前控制住绿皮船长身边的一只小怪，建议控迪菲亚塑风师——他们的冰霜新星很烦。开怪后先杀迪菲亚鹦鹉（非精英，很快就死），再杀剩下的迪菲亚海盗，然后转火船长，同时保持对塑风师的控制。船长的顺劈斩很痛，记得背对人群。他死后回头收拾塑风师。": "Be sure to CC one of the adds next to Captain Greenskin before the pull. I recommend that you CC the Defias Squallshaper as their frost nova ability can be quite annoying. Once you've engaged the boss, begin by killing the Defias Companion first as it is non-elite and will die quickly. After that, kill the remaining Defias Pirate and then swap to Greenskin while keeping your CC on the Squallshaper. Make sure to face Greenskin away from the group as his cleave can be quite nasty. When he dies, finish off the Squallshaper and loot his corpse.",
    "开怪前，考布莱恩身边围着 3 条变异巨蟒，等级 18~19 且非精英，AOE 很容易清掉。先处理这些蟒蛇再转火考布莱恩。和哀嚎洞穴的所有德鲁伊一样，他会施放危险的催眠术，必须立刻打断——目标若是治疗更要优先。战斗中他还会变身为巨蛇形态，伤害提高 50%、攻击速度提高 43%。": "Before the pull, Lord Cobrahn will be surrounded by 3 Deviate Python. They are between levels 18 and 19, and are non-elites, making them easy to AOE down. Prioritize these pythons before switching to Cobrahn. Like all of the Druids in the Wailing Caverns, Cobrahn may cast the dangerous Sleep ability, which should be interrupted immediately, especially if the target is your healer. At some point during the encounter, Cobrahn will transform into a serpent, increasing his damage by 50 and attack speed by 43%.",
    "影牙夜行者 主要在庭院一带，其 反魔法护盾 会让自己 10 秒内对所有魔法免疫。应对全在队伍配置：除坦克外至少再带一名近战，两个更好，免疫期里硬啃更快。": "Shadowfang Moonwalker, found mainly in the courtyard, gains Anti-Magic Shield — immunity to all magical spells for 10 seconds. Dealing with them is about group composition: bring at least one extra melee besides the tank (two is even better) to burn them down faster during the immunity window.",
    "影牙月行者": "Shadowfang Moonwalker",
    "影牙月行者的 反魔法护盾 会获得 10 秒全魔免：队伍里除坦克外至少多带一名近战，免疫期里硬啃更快。": "Shadowfang Moonwalkers gain Anti-Magic Shield, 10 seconds of full magic immunity: bring at least one extra melee besides the tank to burn them through it faster.",
    "怪物普遍会上诅咒、魔法和疾病减益，带上能驱散的职业会轻松很多；不少怪可以剥皮，剥皮师有福了。": "Mobs here love Curses, Magic and Disease debuffs — bring a dispeller. Many mobs are skinnable too, a nice perk for skinners.",
    "怪群几乎全是近战人形怪，AOE 快刷效率极高，也都能被变形术等常规控制。": "Almost every pack is melee humanoids: perfect for AoE farming, and easily crowd-controlled with Polymorph and friends.",
    "所有毒牙德鲁伊（boss 和小怪）都会施放催眠 德鲁伊的睡眠，可沉睡包括坦克和治疗在内的任何人，最长 15 秒：读到就立刻打断。": "Every Druid of the Fang, boss or trash, casts Sleep Druid's Slumber — up to a 15-second incapacitate that can hit your tank or healer. Interrupt it immediately, every time.",
    "打完克尔里斯后点亮阿库麦尔雕像四角的火盆开启事件，共 4 波怪；第一波海龟最危险，需要副坦克、宠物或闪避贼接走一只。": "After Kelris, light the four braziers around the Azshara statue to start the Fire of Aku'mai event: 4 waves total, the first turtle wave being the nastiest — an offtank, a pet or an Evasion-tank rogue needs to pick one up.",
    "拉克佐的房间里有 2 名迪菲亚哨兵，都可以不引到 Boss 单独拉开。实在拉不开就至少控制一名弓手，减少团队承受的伤害。注意引怪后可能跟来巡逻精英。其余是简单的坦克加木桩——拉克佐更像半个 Boss，算是整个副本的热身。": "Rhahk'Zor is flanked by 2 Defias Watchman in his room. Both of them can be pulled without pulling Rhahk'Zor himself. If you are unable to pull them cleanly, make sure to CC at least one archer once to limit the incoming damage your group will be taking. Also, beware of any patrolling elites that might aggro after the pull. Aside from that, this fight is a simple tank-and-spank as Rhahk'Zor is little more than a pseudo-boss and warmup for the dungeon.",
    "指挥官斯普林瓦尔身边两只小怪会一起开怪。第一只闹鬼侍从要快速烧掉；第二只哀嚎卫兵会用 AOE 沉默，可能直接团灭队伍——由猎人或术士宠物单独拉离人群。先杀侍从，再集火斯普林瓦尔并打断他的治疗法术。他倒下后再处理卫兵，同样由宠物或战士/德鲁伊副坦克拉在一边。": "Commander Springvale is flanked by two mobs that will pull with him. The first is a Haunted Servitor, which should be burned down quickly. The second is a Wailing Guardsman, which would pulled by either a hunter or warlock pet away from the group as it can cast an AOE silence that can potentially wipe the party. Make sure to prioritize Springvale after the Servitor is killed, and interrupt his healing spells. Once he's down, take out the guardsman who again should be tanked off to the side by either a pet or possibly a Warrior/Druid offtank.",
    "按 1.12 补丁规则最多可 10 人一起进本，但常规仍是 5 人队。": "Per Patch 1.12 rules up to 10 players may enter together, though 5 remains the typical group size.",
    "接战艾德温·范克里夫时，会有两只迪菲亚黑衣卫兵破隐参战。和重拳先生一样先处理他们：控制一只、标记另一只集火速杀——范克里夫单目标伤害极高，能把坦克撕碎。两只小怪处理完再回头打他。血量到 50% 时他会再召唤两只小怪。整场治疗压力很大，治疗和混合职业要随时补位治疗。首次击杀范克里夫必掉迪菲亚外衣。": "When you engage Edwin VanCleef, two Defias Blackguard will break stealth and attack you as well. Like Mr. Smite, make sure to deal with these mobs first. CC one and 'skull' mark the other and burn it down quickly, as Van Cleef does a tremendous amount of single-target damage and can shred your tank. Once both of the adds are dealt with, focus back on VC. Once he hits 50% health, he will summon 2 more adds for you to deal with. It remains quite heal-intensive so the healers and hybrids in your group should be on their toes and provide spot-healing as it is needed. The Defias Leather Cloak will drop the first time you kill VanCleef.",
    "接近重拳先生前的跳板时，他和两只隐身的迪菲亚黑衣卫兵会自动开怪。重拳先生在 66% 和 33% 血量时施放重拳先生践踏，群体眩晕 10 秒——所以必须在 66% 之前先杀掉两只黑衣卫兵。每次眩晕期间他会跑向宝箱换武器、获得新技能。33% 之后保持坦克满血，避免在重拳猛击期间猝死。处理好小怪和眩晕，其余很直接。": "Mr. Smite and two invisible Defias Blackguard engage automatically as you approach the plank leading up to him. Smite casts Smite Stomp at 66% and 33% health, stunning the group for 10 seconds, so the Blackguards need to be killed before the boss reaches 66%. During these stuns, the boss will run to a chest and pick up a weapon and adding new abilities. After 33%, make sure the tank is topped up to avoid sudden death during a Smite Slam. Aside from the adds and stuns, this is a straightforward encounter.",
    "斯卡姆是个简单的坦克加木桩 Boss，只有一个值得注意的技能：连环闪电——类似链式闪电，近战站得近就会一次打到 3 个人。近战围着 Boss 分散站位即可；就算没散开，这个技能本身伤害也不高。斯卡姆完全是可选 Boss，但掉落值得打。": "Skum is a simple tank-and-spank boss with only one significant ability; Chained Bolt. This is a chain lightning-style spell that will strike three melee units if they are close together. Make sure your melee spread out around the boss to avoid the damage. Spreading out is not a hard requirement, as the ability itself deals minimal damage. Skum is entirely optional, but his loot makes him worthwhile.",
    "斯尼德的伐木机开打前必须清空房间里所有采掘员，否则恐惧会把人引到怪堆里。": "Before Sneed's Shredder, clear every Miner in the room or the fear can pull your group into extra mobs.",
    "斯尼德的伐木机这场仗在开怪前就开始了：因为伐木机会施放恐吓，必须先把整个房间的地精木匠清空，否则玩家被恐惧跑进怪堆就会团灭。清完房间后 Boss 本身非常直白——伐木机被击毁后，斯尼德会从机器里跳出来亲自接战。他有个缴械技能，对正在抢仇恨的坦克很烦人，给坦克留足建立仇恨的时间再全力输出。整体是场简单遭遇战。": "The Sneed's Shredder fight begins before pulling the boss. Due to the Shredder's Terrify ability, the entire room must be cleared of all Goblin Woodcarver. Otherwise, players might be feared into them and cause a wipe. Aside from clearing the room, the boss is a very straightforward tank-and-spank. Once the Shredder has been defeated, Sneed will hop out of the machine and continue the fight himself. He has a disarm ability that can be annoying for tanks trying to pick up aggro, so give the tank ample time to acquire threat before going ham on the boss. Overall, this is a simple boss encounter.",
    "暮光领主克尔里斯的沉睡术可能点中治疗：坦克保持满血，混合职业随时补奶。": "Twilight Lord Kelris' sleep can catch your healer off guard: keep the tank topped off and have hybrids assist healing.",
    "暴风城法师区地下的监狱：5 个 boss 加稀有精英、流程极短、怪群密集，联盟练级路上最快的副本之一。": "The prison beneath Stormwind's Mage Quarter: 5 bosses plus a rare, a very short linear run packed with dense pulls — one of the fastest XP dungeons for the Alliance.",
    "曲奇最难的部分反而是从船上跳下去开怪：底层甲板挤满精英，跳的时机不对很容易连带引怪。跳对了就把曲奇往副本出口方向拉，战斗本身是简单的坦克加木桩。记得打断烹制甜点——给它回一大口血。其余都简单。": "The most challenging part about Cookie is the leap off the ship to engage him. The bottom deck of the ship is packed with elites that can easily aggro if a jump is not timed correctly. Assuming you've timed the jump correctly, pull Cookie off the ship towards the exit of the dungeon. The fight is a simple tank-and-spank. Make sure to interrupt the Cookie's Cooking spell as it heals Cookie for a fair chunk. The rest is easy.",
    "最终 boss 瑟玛普拉格的六台炸弹投放器会不断放出 步行炸弹：可以集火提前打掉炸弹，也可以指定一人去按投放器右侧的按钮关闭它。": "During the Mekgineer Thermaplugg fight, six bomb dispensers keep spawning Walking Bombs: either kill the bombs before they reach the group, or assign a player to shut each dispenser down with the button on its right-hand side.",
    "本副本是游戏里第一个非线性副本，岔路众多，新手很容易迷路，进本前先认好地图。": "This is the game's first non-linear dungeon with many forks — new groups get lost easily, so study the map before entering.",
    "机械师瑟玛普拉格在副本最深处的技工庭。战斗中会有步行炸弹从六个炸弹投放器里刷出来：可以在炸弹靠近前杀掉，也可以安排一名玩家按投放器右侧的按钮关停投放器。": "Mekgineer Thermaplugg is located at the end of the instance in the Tinkers' Court. During the encounter, Walking Bombs will spawn from the six bomb dispensers. Groups can either kill the bombs before they reach the group, or designate a player to shut down the bomb dispensers by pressing the button on the right-hand side of each dispenser.",
    "格里哈斯特本身不难，小麻烦是他的房间挤满鱼人。战斗无需解释，但开 Boss 前务必小心清掉房间四周的小怪——他的投网会把坦克定在尴尬位置、顺势引到别的怪群，所以先清场再开 Boss。打死后点他身后的祭坛领一个小增益。": "Gelihast is a straightforward encounter with a small twist - his room is packed with Murlocs. While the fight with Geli requires no explanation, you must be very careful when pulling the adds around the room prior to pulling the boss. Gelihast has a nasty net ability which can leave your tank in an awkward position to subsequently pull additional mobs, so it is crucial that you clear his room first before you pull him. Once he's dead, click on the altar behind him for a small buff.",
    "格鲁比斯在副本入口附近、与齿轮厅相连的洞穴区。和爆破专家艾米·短线对话开启事件：怪物会从洞穴里涌出，艾米引爆炸药封洞之前，格鲁比斯会从第二个洞穴里被炸出来。": "Grubbis is located near the instance entrance in the cave area connected to the Hall of Gears. To start the event to spawn Grubbis, speak to Blastmaster Emi Shortfuse. Once the event has started, mobs will spawn from the cave before Emi triggers explosives to close it off. Grubbis will spawn from the second cave before the explosives go off.",
    "梦游者克尔里斯算不上危险的 Boss，唯一要防的是他的催眠术——治疗被打睡了会很被动。保持坦克血线健康，治疗真被睡了就让所有混合职业帮忙刷坦克。": "Twilight Lord Kelris is not a particularly dangerous boss, although his sleep ability may catch your healer off guard. Make sure to keep the tank topped off in the event the healer is slept, and have all hybrid classes heal the tank if such an event happens.",
    "死亡之誓是稀有精英，顺劈伤害严重，必须拉离人群。如果和哀嚎卫兵一起引到，至少把它拉在离卫兵 10 码外，避免吃 AOE 沉默。其余就是坦克加木桩。": "Deathsworn Captain is a rare elite that should be tanked away from the group as his cleave ability can do a severe amount of damage. If you will him with any wailing guardsmen, make sure to tank him at least 10 yards away from the guardsman to avoid the AOE silence. Aside from that, the fight is a tank and spank.",
    "毒牙德鲁伊": "Druid of the Fang",
    "永生者沃尔丹只有一个关键技能：把 10 码内所有目标定身 10 秒并击倒 2 秒，还带伤害——治疗要盯紧全队血线。远程输出站最远距离躲开定身。其余照旧打木桩。打完他记得点他身后的祭坛，解锁瀑布捷径。": "Verdan the Everliving has one significant ability, which roots all targets within 10 yards for 10 seconds and knocks them down for 2 seconds. The ability does damage as well, so healers should keep their eye on the group's health pools. Ranged DPS should stand at max range to avoid the root. Aside from that, Verdan is a tank-and-spank and should always be killed to unlock the waterfall shortcut behind him.",
    "沿大路一路向西走进银松森林；": "follow the main road west into Silverpine Forest;",
    "沿大路向西北走到佐拉姆海岸；": "head northwest along the main path to the Zoram Strand;",
    "沿贫瘠之地大路一路向北，走到地图东北角，从人流较少的西门潜入奥格瑞玛；": "run north along the Barrens to its northeastern tip and sneak into Orgrimmar through the less-populated west entrance;",
    "沿路南下进入北贫瘠之地；": "head south into the Northern Barrens;",
    "沿路向南进入月溪镇，在镇子里找到矿井入口；": "travel south into Moonbrook and find the mine entrance;",
    "灰谷佐拉姆海岸下的水底神殿：6 个 boss、流程较长，多片水域要留意呼吸条。": "A sunken temple off the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale: 6 bosses across a long, watery layout — keep an eye on your breath meter.",
    "狼王南杜斯待在谷仓式的房间里，四只座狼绕着他转。开怪前先清掉所有座狼；若引到一起，也先杀狼再转火他。战斗中他会周期性召唤座狼，出来立刻秒掉再回头打他。这场仗核心就是优先处理小怪，做到就稳过。": "Four Worgs circle Wolf Master Nandos in a barn-like room, make sure to kill all Worgs before engaging him. If you pull the Worgs alongside him, make sure to kill them first before transitioning back to Nandos. He will summon Worgs periodically throughout the fight. Make sure to kill them instantly before switching back to Nandos. This fight is all about prioritizing adds first so if you can do that you will be fine.",
    "瑟拉吉斯是可选的宝库怪，几乎没有技能。唯一要注意的是水下战斗时的呼吸条——经典旧世的憋气时间短得多。": "Old Serra'kis is an optional loot pinata with no real abilities. The only thing you should be mindful of is your breath meter while under water. Remember, in Classic WoW, the breath meter lasts far less time.",
    "瑟芬迪斯是第 4 位也是最后一位毒牙德鲁伊，技能与其他三人相同，唯一威胁还是催眠术。打断好催眠术，这场仗轻而易举。与同伴不同的是，瑟芬迪斯可以不带任何小怪单独开怪，是几位里最简单的一场。": "Lord Serpentis is the last of the 4 Druids of the Fang. He shares abilities with his counterparts and is only dangerous due to his Sleep ability. As with the other Druids, interrupt Sleep, and the fight is a cakewalk. Unlike the other Druids, Serptenis can be pulled without any additional trash, making this encounter easier than the rest.",
    "电刑器6000型 掉落车间钥匙——需要开后门的队伍记得留人拾取。": "Electrocutioner 6000 drops the Workman's Key — groups needing the backdoor should make sure someone loots it.",
    "电刑器6000型在发射湾的高架发射台上，悬在房间中央环形走道的上方。": "Electrocutioner 6000 is located in the Launch Bay on the elevated launch pad, suspended above the circular walkway at the center of the room.",
    "皮萨斯和其他德鲁伊同伴一样，危险点全在催眠术。他身边还有一只额外的毒牙德鲁伊和一只变异蹒跚者：控制住德鲁伊，皮萨斯一读催眠术就打断。先集火秒掉蹒跚者再转火 Boss，但要留坦克或一名近战盯住皮萨斯，保证催眠术被打断。": "Lord Pythas, like his fellow Druid counterparts, is most dangerous due to his 'Sleep' ability. Additionally, he is flanked by one additional Druid of the Fang and a Deviate Shambler. Make sure to CC the Druid and interrupt Pythas whenever he casts Sleep. Prioritize the Shambler and burn it down before switching to Pythas, but make sure either your tank or one melee DPS stays focused on Pythas, so the Sleep is interrupted.",
    "盲眼守卫奥杜身边有两只邪蝠会随他一起开怪。蝙蝠有缴械和顺劈，坦克要把它们背对人群；有法师可以变羊一只。缴械很烦，先让坦克建立仇恨再全力输出。先杀蝙蝠再转火奥杜，就没问题。": "Odo the Blindwatcher is flanked by 2 Vile Bat which will pull with him once engaged. These bats have a disarm and a cleave ability, so they should be faced away from the group while being tanked. One of the bats may be polymorphed if you have a mage. Make sure to let the tank generate some threat before going ham on the boss as the disarm can be quite annoying to deal. Kill the bats first before switching over to Odo, and you should be fine.",
    "矿工约翰森是标准的坦克加木桩。他有一个降低坦克护甲的单体技能，除了治疗坦克压力较大外没有难点。问题是他周围围着大量迪菲亚矿工——虽然是非精英、血量少，开怪前尽量先清掉。建议队里有混合输出职业的话，刺穿护甲减甲期间帮忙给坦克补治疗，稳拿击杀。": "Miner Johnson is the epitome of a tank-and-spank. He has one single target ability that reduces the tanks armor, so aside from the fight requiring intensive tank healing, it is a straightforward encounter. The only problem is that he is surrounded by numerous Defias Miner. However, they are non-elites with small health pools. Try to pick as many of them off as possible before pulling Johnson. I recommend that if you happen to have a hybrid DPS class in your group, have the hybrid also heal the tank when the Pierce Armor debuff is up to guarantee the kill.",
    "稀有怪布吕格尔·铁拳掉落全本最好的装备，碰到别错过。": "The rare Bruegal Ironknuckle drops the best loot in the dungeon — don't skip him if he's up.",
    "穿过矿道走到副本门——矿道里有怪，建议组队同行。": "fight your way through the mine to the instance portal — there are mobs along the way, so go as a group.",
    "粘性辐射尘在齿轮厅的辐射地面上。建议先清掉周围小怪，确保开怪时不带小怪。": "Viscous Fallout is located in the Hall of Gears on the irradiated ground level. It is recommended to clear out the trash mobs around them so they can be pulled without any adds.",
    "继续向西再略微向北，到达焚木村北侧的影牙城堡入口。": "continue west and then a bit north to reach Shadowfang Keep, just north of Pyrewood Village.",
    "群体打击者9-60在工程实验室内，位于南侧高处的平台上。": "Crowd Pummeler 9-60 is located in the Engineering Labs and can be found on the upper southern ledge.",
    "船舱区巡逻很多，经常趁大家打完 boss 舔包、吃喝放松警惕时偷袭：杀完 boss 别松懈，多转视角看身后。": "The ship is patrolled heavily, and patrols love to catch groups while they loot, roll and drink after a boss kill — stay alert and pan your camera.",
    "范克里夫 50% 血时会再召唤 2 只小怪，战斗全程治疗压力大，混合职业要随时补奶坦克。": "VanCleef summons 2 more adds at 50% health; the fight is heal-intensive throughout, so hybrids should spot-heal the tank.",
    "萨利维丝带着两只娜迦巡逻。开她之前先清掉洞穴里的小怪，开怪前至少控制住一名护卫，集火杀掉小怪后转火萨利维丝。": "Lady Sarevess patrols the area with 2 other Naga. Make sure to clear out the cave before pulling her and her 2 bodyguards. Make sure to CC at least one of the bodyguards before engaging her. Focus the add down and switch to Sarevess.",
    "西部荒野月溪镇矿井深处的海盗巢穴：8 个 boss（含稀有怪）、流程线性，多数联盟玩家的第一个副本。": "A pirate den deep in the Moonbrook mine of Westfall: 8 bosses (one rare) on a linear route — most Alliance players' first dungeon.",
    "迪克斯特·瓦德是本副本里最棘手的 boss 之一，难点全在他的破胆怒吼。开怪前把周边走廊的小怪清干净，防止恐惧期间有人连带引到更多小怪。如果和迪克斯特开怪时带出了额外的迪菲亚小怪，尽量控制住它们、先集火秒掉迪克斯特——他的恐惧惩罚极重。只要开怪前把周边房间清理到位，这场战斗就没有任何难度。": "Dextren Ward is one of the most challenging bosses in this dungeon due to his Intimidating Shout. Make sure to clear all of the adds in the surrounding corridors, so no one in your group mistakenly pulls additional adds during the fear duration. If you pull extra Defias mobs with Dextren, make sure to CC them as best you can and focus down Dextren first, as his fear can be tremendously punishing. If you have done a good job with clearing the adds and the rooms around him, this fight should be no problem at all.",
    "迪克斯特·瓦德的恐惧 破胆怒吼 非常危险：开怪前清干净周边走廊的小怪，防止恐惧期间连带引到怪群。": "Dextren Ward's fear Intimidating Shout is brutal: clear every add in the surrounding corridors first so the fear cannot drag in extras.",
    "迪菲亚囚徒 是全本最烦人的小怪之一，其 缴械 会缴械，让坦克很难建立仇恨。面对多只囚犯时，输出给坦克足够的建立仇恨时间，能控场就控场。": "Defias Prisoner is one of the most tedious mobs in the dungeon: its Disarm disarms and makes it hard for tanks to generate threat. Against multiple Prisoners, give the tank time to build threat before attacking, and CC if you can.",
    "迪菲亚囚犯": "Defias Prisoner",
    "迪菲亚囚犯的 缴械（缴械）会让坦克很难建立仇恨：面对多只囚犯时，输出等坦克拉稳再动手，能控就控。": "Defias Prisoners use Disarm (Disarm), which makes threat-building hard for the tank: against multiple prisoners, let the tank build threat before attacking and CC what you can.",
    "迪菲亚塑造师": "Defias Squallshaper",
    "迪菲亚塑风师 是船舱区的法系怪，其 冰霜新星（冰霜新星）对坦克和近战非常烦人：拉怪时全队贴着坦克站，避免有人卡在死区被新星吹开；还要提防巡逻的塑造师，别被吹离队伍。": "Defias Squallshaper is a caster mob in the Dreadnaught room whose Frost Nova can be frustrating for tanks and melee: stack the group on the tank when pulling so nobody gets caught in a dead zone, and beware patrolling Squallshapers novaing you out of position.",
    "部落有传送捷径：在奥格瑞玛找 接「主工程师斯库提」任务（20 级可接），坐棘齿城到藏宝海湾的船，在码头下层、旅馆附近找 完成任务，用地精传送器直接传送进副本。": "Horde can teleport in: pick up the Chief Engineer Scooty quest from at the shop in Orgrimmar (level 20+), take the boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay, find on the lower floor of the docks near the inn, complete the quest and get beamed straight into the dungeon with the Goblin Transponder.",
    "部落有传送捷径：在奥格瑞玛的商店找 接「主工程师斯库提」任务（20 级可接），坐棘齿城到藏宝海湾的船，在码头下层、旅馆附近找 交任务，用地精传送器直接传送进本。": "Horde have a teleport shortcut: pick up the Chief Engineer Scooty quest from at the shop in Orgrimmar (available at level 20), take the boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay, find on the lower docks floor near the inn, and get beamed straight into the dungeon with the Goblin Transponder.",
    "部落来此极其麻烦，多数人直接放弃：坐飞艇到荆棘谷的格罗姆高营地，沿海岸向北游到西部荒野南端上岸，向东穿过艾尔文森林北上暴风城；进城前脱光装备，做好多次跑尸的准备。": "Getting here as Horde is a nightmare most skip: zeppelin to Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale, swim north along the shore to the southern tip of Westfall, head east through Elwynn Forest and up into Stormwind — stripping off all your gear and being ready for several rez-runs.",
    "部落路线较远：坐飞艇到荆棘谷的格罗姆高营地，沿海岸线一路向北游到西部荒野南端上岸，再前往月溪镇。": "A long trip for Horde: take the zeppelin to Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale, swim north along the shoreline to the southern tip of Westfall, then head to Moonbrook.",
    "银松森林的狼人古堡：8 个 boss、流程线性，部落玩家 22~30 级的经典刷本，联盟路途较远。": "A worgen-infested keep in Silverpine Forest: 8 bosses on a linear route — a Classic Horde leveling staple, though a long trip for the Alliance.",
    "银白男爵的 暗影迷雾 会降低目标 75% 受治疗效果：混合职业随时帮忙奶坦克，否则坦克倒得很快。": "Baron Silverlaine's Veil of Shadow Veil of Shadow cuts healing received by 75%: hybrids should assist with tank healing or the tank drops fast.",
    "阿库麦尔是坦克加木桩，但狂怒状态下单目标伤害巨大。远离他的毒云，让治疗专注刷坦克；混合职业尽量帮忙治疗，坦克有血瓶就磕。总体非常简单。": "Aku'mai is a tank and spank with massive single target damage due to his frenzy ability. Make sure to stay away from his poison cloud so the healer can focus heals on the tank. Hybrid classes should offer healing assistance here if possible, and the tank should use a health pot if he has one. Overall, this is a very simple fight.",
    "阿鲁高是本副本最难的 Boss。虚空箭伤害巨大，暗影传送让他很难被锁住。进场后让远程立刻站上平台，无论他传到哪里都能打到。近战也站在平台上等阿鲁高传送过来再打，免得追着他跑时把治疗拉脱。": "Arugal is by far the hardest boss in the dungeon. His Void Bolts hit for a massive amount of damage, and his teleport makes him difficult to lock down. To make this as easy as possible, have your ranged DPS stand on the platform as soon as you enter his room. They should be able to DPS Arugal down from that point no matter where he teleports. Have your melee DPS stand there as well and wait for Argual's teleport to their location, so they don't end up lining the healer while trying to chase him down.",
    "雷希戈尔是最纯粹的坦克加木桩。唯一技能灵魂消耗可以无视，血量也不高，掉落却对得起难度。唯一要注意的是他周围的小怪：先拉开两只再开 Boss，剩下那只惨白座狼变羊或先集火烧掉，再转火雷希戈尔。": "Rethilgore is a tank and spank in the truest sense of the word. His only ability, Soul Drain, is negligable. He also has a moderately low health pool and a Loot table comparable to his difficulty. The only thing you should be aware of are the mobs surrounding him, 2 of which should be pulled prior to engaging the boss. The one mob that will remain, a Bleak Worg, should be polymorphed or burned down first prior to switching DPS to Rethilgore.",
    "飞到希尔斯布莱德丘陵的南海镇；": "Fly to Southshore in the Hillsbrad Foothills;",
    "飞到灰谷的阿斯特兰纳；": "Fly to Astranaar in Ashenvale;",
    "飞到石爪山脉的烈日石居，穿风怒小径进入灰谷，沿大路向西北走到佐拉姆海岸，在水边找到副本入口。": "Fly to Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains, take the Talondeep Path into Ashenvale, then follow the main path northwest to the Zoram Strand to find the entrance.",
    "飞到西部荒野的哨兵岭；": "Fly to Sentinel Hill in Westfall;",
    "飞到银松森林的瑟伯切尔，沿大路向南走，再向西就能看到焚木村北侧的城堡入口。": "Fly to The Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest, travel south along the road, then west until you reach the Keep north of Pyrewood Village.",
    "饥饿者塔拉加曼站在熔岩包围的平台中央。让坦克把他拉离平台边缘，避免上钩拳把他打飞下台。远程尽量站最远距离，把火焰新星的伤害降到最低。其余就是常规的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。": "Taragaman the Hungerer is stationed in the middle of a platform surrounded by lava. Have your tank pull him away from the edges of the platform so that Uppercut does not knock him off the platform. Make sure your range is at max range so Fire Nova inflicts minimal damage. The rest of the fight is a basic tank-and-spank.",
    "饥饿者塔拉加曼站在熔岩平台上：坦克把他拉离平台边缘，远程站最大距离，减少 火焰新星 的伤害，也避免 上钩拳 把人打飞下台。": "Taragaman the Hungerer stands on a lava-ringed platform: have the tank pull him away from the edge, keep ranged at max distance so Fire Nova deals minimal damage and Uppercut cannot knock anyone off.",
    "黑铁大师在副本深处通往技工庭的路上。因为是稀有怪，不一定每次都刷；刷新时通常在通往机械师瑟玛普拉格的隧道北段巡逻。": "Dark Iron Ambassador is located near the end of the instance leading up to the Tinkers' Court. Given their rare nature, they may not always spawn. If they do spawn, they tend to patrol on the north side of the tunnel leading to Mekgineer Thermaplugg.",
}
